{
  "slug": "kentucky-derby-marathon-2021",
  "title": "Run50 #第1州｜肯塔基第二篇：Derby 全马｜“传奇跑者”的半年流水账",
  "page": "/run50/wechat/kentucky-derby-marathon-2021-modern-rail.html",
  "status": "pending",
  "entry_fix": false,
  "intro": "从搬家、Waverly 半马，到 2021 年阴雨大风里的 Kentucky Derby Festival Marathon，再到疫苗、驾照、local running 和重新打开的美国。",
  "map": "/assets/cn-article-maps/us-light-322942d44d981f33.png",
  "poster": "../../assets/cover-medal-zh-index-kentucky-derby-2021-cn-flat.jpg?v=20260704-ky21-louisville",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "前言"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>在美国呆了一年，感觉挺无聊的，更甭提又赶上疫情弗洛伊德大选寒流，听很多人说，国外就是好山好水好无聊，但我觉得不对，因为这山这水，我也没觉得有多好。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-001.webp",
      "caption": "搬家 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "搬家 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>2021这半年应该是从搬家开始的，房东是个倔老头，听说很不好对付。和老头交涉了两次，感觉有点像《海蒂和爷爷》里刚出场的老爷子，总之就是很生硬。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-002.webp",
      "caption": "Downtown by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Downtown by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-003.webp",
      "caption": "Downtown by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Downtown by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>搬了新家，也冬眠挺久的了，正好<span data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">跑个步熟悉熟悉环境</span>，一路沿着街道跑到了downtown，天气阴沉沉的，疫情里的城市也没多少活力，偶尔跑过街边的桥洞，总会被一群流浪汉盯的不寒而栗。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-004.webp",
      "caption": "Ohio river by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Ohio river by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>没跑多远，累够呛，完全没有巅峰时候的风采，作为传奇跑者，其实我也没那么佛系。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-005.webp",
      "caption": "Ohio river by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Ohio river by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-006.webp",
      "caption": "Ohio river by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Ohio river by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "Waverly半马"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>就这样，我赶紧报名个半马，提醒自己，我可是跑圈传奇，可不能这么油腻。疫情里比赛少的可怜，仅有的几个能跑的都在几十公里外的公园trail，也只能割肉打车了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-007.webp",
      "caption": "Broad Run Park by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Broad Run Park by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-008.webp",
      "caption": "起跑点 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "起跑点 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>Broad Run Park的小半马，没几个人，因为疫情，大家分开起跑，所以就让这段路显得更加孤单，伴随着一月底的冬雨和冷风，走走跑跑的完赛。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-009.webp",
      "caption": "Broad Run Park by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Broad Run Park by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-010.webp",
      "caption": "Broad Run Park by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Broad Run Park by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>惊喜也有，公园里的黄色silo，像极了武汉的失落之塔，让人眼前一亮。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-011.webp",
      "caption": "Silo by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Silo by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-012.webp",
      "caption": "Silo by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Silo by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>赛后，当我发现自己跑个半马都这么费劲了，这让我认识到问题的严重性，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">得抓紧时间锻炼身体</span>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-013.webp",
      "caption": "奖牌 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "奖牌 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "Derby全马"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>一晃两个月，Derby来了，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">肯塔基州最大的马拉松</span>，不过今年因为疫情，分天分时起跑，所以并不热烈。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-014.webp",
      "caption": "起点涂鸦 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "起点涂鸦 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-015.webp",
      "caption": "起点 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "起点 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>跑步日，又是个阴天，赛前天气预报说，我注定要被淋成落汤鸡。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-016.webp",
      "caption": "壮胖子 by marathonfoto",
      "alt": "壮胖子 by marathonfoto"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-017.webp",
      "caption": "20 mile by Arsenan",
      "alt": "20 mile by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>前三十公里其实还好，雨不大，跑起来还挺舒服，是传奇跑者喜欢的节奏，不过后面十几公里确实艰难，和去年的Louisville全马简直是两个极端，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">大风吹的我打晃，大雨淋的我打颤</span>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-018.webp",
      "caption": "壮子 by marathonfoto",
      "alt": "壮子 by marathonfoto"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-019.webp",
      "caption": "雨里摄影师 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "雨里摄影师 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>温暖也有，旁边的赛道工作人员，一直骑着自行车和救助包跟着我，不时过来问一下\"You good?\"，我会假笑一下然后竖起大拇指，表示OK，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">这是传奇跑者最后的倔强</span>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-020.webp",
      "caption": "壮子傻笑 by marathonfoto",
      "alt": "壮子傻笑 by marathonfoto"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-021.webp",
      "caption": "New Albany by Arsenan",
      "alt": "New Albany by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>费了挺大劲，终于回到了终点，雨下得更大了，也没个地躲雨，也不给口热汤，今年的补给确实不太行。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-022.webp",
      "caption": "大雨 by marathonfoto",
      "alt": "大雨 by marathonfoto"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>赛后花了40多刀，买了跑步照片，回头去看，虽然狼狈，但至少照片里，我还是挺enjoy的，算是挺有趣的回忆，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">至少又完成了一场全马</span>，还可以自称是传奇。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-023.webp",
      "caption": "Derby 奖牌 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Derby 奖牌 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "美国也还行，没那么凑活"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>三四月份扎了两针辉瑞，晕了两天，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"color\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">四月底拿到正式驾照，开车自由</span>。感觉一下子就打开了我的任督二脉，生活一下子精彩了起来。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-024.webp",
      "caption": "疫苗 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "疫苗 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>美国，其实也没那么凑活，好像还行。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-025.webp",
      "caption": "Bernheim Arboretum by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Bernheim Arboretum by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-026.webp",
      "caption": "Bernheim Arboretum by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Bernheim Arboretum by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>去个几十公里外的公园打卡，放飞机。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-027.webp",
      "caption": "Snow running group by Someone",
      "alt": "Snow running group by Someone"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-028.webp",
      "caption": "FF running group by Arsenan",
      "alt": "FF running group by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>参加各种local的小跑步，再也不用担心丢自行车了。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-029.webp",
      "caption": "Hiking (Jim&Siqi) by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Hiking (Jim&Siqi) by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-030.webp",
      "caption": "Hiking (Cindy&Pipen) by Santosh",
      "alt": "Hiking (Cindy&Pipen) by Santosh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-031.webp",
      "caption": "Hiking (Zoe&胖子&Santosh&Siqi) by Cindy",
      "alt": "Hiking (Zoe&胖子&Santosh&Siqi) by Cindy"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>和Cindy一家去Red River Gorge Hiking，吃BBQ看音乐会，家里坐客。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-032.webp",
      "caption": "Mike Mains & The Branches by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Mike Mains & The Branches by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-033.webp",
      "caption": "买了两个专辑(减肥) by Santosh",
      "alt": "买了两个专辑(减肥) by Santosh"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最开心的是，美国正常的大马拉松马上要回来了，确实有点迫不及待。当然作为\"传奇跑者”，还是要先减下去十几斤肉，总有那么一天我这个传奇跑者可以名副其实，不仅仅是调侃。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-034.webp",
      "caption": "国际跑步日奖牌 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "国际跑步日奖牌 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "heading",
      "title": "后记"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>今年因为寒流，Louisville的雪下的很大，有点一夜回到东北的感觉。房东老爷子请我帮忙扫雪，简单聊了下，才知道他竟然去过哈尔滨，还show他一直track哈尔滨的天气。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-035.webp",
      "caption": "冬天 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "冬天 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>其实老头也没那么生硬，有时候也挺好玩的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-036.webp",
      "caption": "Paul by Arsenan",
      "alt": "Paul by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>前几天看朋友晒黄石公园的风景，好像美国这山山水水也没那么不堪。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-037.webp",
      "caption": "城市又运转了 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "城市又运转了 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>最近健身房的口罩禁令解除，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"3\">跑步也慢慢开始找到状态</span>，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"0\">停滞的时间又开始流动起来</span>。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-038.webp",
      "caption": "春天 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "春天 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>2021这半年，看到大地从寒冬走向了盛夏，城市也从lockdown回到了open，街上人也多了起来。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-039.webp",
      "caption": "夏天 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "夏天 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>好像是又来了一次美国，突然就觉得，<span data-cn-emphasis=\"underline\" data-cn-tone=\"1\">城市可以lockdown，但人真不该lockdown</span>，毕竟作为\"传奇跑者”，应该是<span data-cn-emphasis=\"bold\" data-cn-tone=\"2\">不断拓展认知边界</span>的。</p>"
    },
    {
      "kind": "figure",
      "src": "/run50/stories/chinese/Run50-Kentucky-Derby-Marathon-2021-clean_files/img-040.webp",
      "caption": "城市夜景 by Arsenan",
      "alt": "城市夜景 by Arsenan"
    },
    {
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "html": "<p>欢迎在微信留言区继续补充你的跑马故事。</p>"
    }
  ]
}